          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f26de6f49861d0efb3d74501559b3a839b892c2b",
          "message": "feat: extend coefficient algebra for symbolic phases (#240)\n\n* feat: extend coefficient algebra for symbolic phases\n\nAdd a raw symbolic coefficient fallback for expressions that cannot be\nrepresented by the native or polynomial tiers.\n\nPreserve compact expim phases through simplification, substitution,\ndifferentiation, unitary transformations, printing, and averaging.\nCanonicalize complex coefficient slots and add regression coverage for\nphase algebra and average round-trips.\n\n* add changelog and format\n\n* cleanup\n\n* Enhance polynomial representation and operations with exact rational coefficients\n\n- Updated the `Monomial` struct to support exact Gaussian rationals alongside floating-point scalars, improving precision in polynomial calculations.\n- Introduced new inline functions for scalar multiplication and addition that handle both `ComplexF64` and `ExactComplex` types, ensuring accurate arithmetic operations.\n- Modified polynomial multiplication and addition functions to utilize the new scalar operations, maintaining the integrity of exact coefficients.\n- Added tests to verify the preservation of exact rational coefficients in various operations, including averaging and phase decomposition.\n- Improved printing functionality to differentiate between exact and floating-point representations of coefficients.\n- Enhanced JET testing to include new cases for phase terms and complex coefficients, ensuring robustness in symbolic computations.\n\n* format\n\n* fix docs\n\n* Enhance coefficient handling and symbolic simplification for exact rational coefficients\n\n* format\n\n* bump 0.11\n\n* fix changelog\n\n* fix changelog\n\n* format\n\n* more perf regression fixes\n\n* more perrf fixes\n\n* Fix JET\n\n* add phase term to docs\n\n* fix coverage",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-31T14:47:45+02:00",
          "tree_id": "200ce3b2e5db77a2e0b8e0271c93c21d49d495bf",
