          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f5ade26d1cfb60159ec4c6290f4780385214a2a3",
          "message": "fix: keep radicals of exact numbers exact in coefficients (#283)\n\nrational_power evaluated a radical natively whenever its base recognized\ninto the native tier. Integers live there because ComplexF64 represents\nthem exactly, but their radicals it does not, so sqrt(Num(2)) became\n1.4142135623730951 while sqrt(Num(1//2)), whose base lives in the exact\nPoly tier, stayed symbolic.\n\nSymbolicUtils 4.46.8 and later rewrite sqrt(1//2) as sqrt(2)/2 during\nsimplify, so an exact prefactor such as sqrt(1//2) turned into a float\nafter one simplify. Downstream this broke exact symbolic Gram\nfactorizations in FloquetExpansions.jl.\n\nA radical of a nonnegative Int or Rational{Int} now folds only when its\nroot is rational (sqrt(4) = 2, sqrt(1//4) = 1//2) and otherwise stays a\nsymbolic leaf. Floating-point bases keep the native fold.",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-27T08:44:27+02:00",
          "tree_id": "c6c4c48f0edfb90481e0c5ac4291dad3e169d080",
          "url": "https://github.com/qojulia/SecondQuantizedAlgebra.jl/commit/f5ade26d1cfb60159ec4c6290f4780385214a2a3"
