          "message": "build(deps): update QuantumToolbox requirement from 0.47 to 0.47, 0.49 (#282)\n\n* build(deps): update QuantumToolbox requirement from 0.47 to 0.47, 0.49\n\nUpdates the requirements on [QuantumToolbox](https://github.com/qutip/QuantumToolbox.jl) to permit the latest version.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/qutip/QuantumToolbox.jl/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/qutip/QuantumToolbox.jl/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/qutip/QuantumToolbox.jl/compare/v0.47.0...v0.49.0)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: QuantumToolbox\n  dependency-version: 0.49.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* build(deps): update QuantumToolbox version to allow 0.47, 0.48, and 0.49\n\n* build(ci): update force_latest_compatible_version for Dependabot branches\n\n* build(ci): fix indentation in workflow configuration for julia-runtest step\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Orjan Ameye <orjan.ameye@hotmail.com>",
