          "message": "fix: count excluded sites in constrained sums and substitution (#296)\n\n* fix: count excluded sites in constrained sums and substitution\n\n* fix: eliminate sum binders to a fixpoint and keep kept binders' constraints\n\nNested constrained sums undercounted because elimination ran in one pass over the\nnew binder only, and diagonal and per-term QAdds were built without index scope,\npruning constraints of binders still summed over.",
