          "message": "docs: rewrite the manual and developer docs; fix unitary, adjoint and numeric bugs (#302)\n\n* docs: rewrite the manual and developer docs; fix unitary, adjoint and numeric bugs\n\n* fix\n\n* less akward openings\n\n* docs: integrate GKSL extraction and coefficient introspection into the manual\n\nPlace the #301 API in the manual pages, reorder the open systems page so the\ncavity example runs through to its steady state, complete the new docstrings,\nand render a zero expression as 0 in LaTeX.\n\n* apply docs reviews",
