          "message": "feat: exact harmonic projection (harmonics, harmonic, secular) (#311)\n\n* feat: exact harmonic projection (harmonics, harmonic, secular)\n\nProject coefficients, operators, SuperOperators and Lindbladians onto exact\nFourier components expim(n*ω*t). Phases that are not integer harmonics of ω\nthrow instead of being dropped or misassigned.\n\n* Fix concrete storage for harmonic Lindbladian builders\n\n* Remove source comments introduced by this change\n\n* Fix radical factor order assertion across Julia versions",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-15T15:28:56+02:00",
          "tree_id": "cb770621657318aa95998f0725d815e4865d7332",
          "url": "https://github.com/qojulia/SecondQuantizedAlgebra.jl/commit/51f36d678cf37410f488997a1d3b5386841b1d09"
