          "id": "f2c7debb99875b5930fa067def9674305b9d56ae",
          "message": "feat: public map_coefficients for QAdd, SuperOperator and Lindbladian (#307)\n\n* feat: public map_coefficients for QAdd, SuperOperator and Lindbladian\n\nCoefficient maps now count a summation index whose dependence the mapped\ncoefficient loses, which also fixes simplify/expand/exponential_form/\ntrigonometric_form on sums such as Σᵢ (cos²gᵢ + sin²gᵢ) a'a.\n\n* Fix radical factor order assertion across Julia versions",
