          "id": "2af6bd9891996e5cc6075588be361cd152a2c0c6",
          "message": "feat: public coefficient lookup for an operator product (#304)\n\n* feat: public coefficient lookup for an operator product\n\nAdd coefficient(expr, term) to read the coefficient of one canonical\noperator product (or 1 for the scalar part) in a polynomial, and\ncoefficient(S, sandwich) for one sandwich of a SuperOperator. Mismatched\nor multiple index constraints and summed expressions throw instead of\nreading as zero.\n\n* Fix radical factor order assertion across Julia versions",
