          "id": "b1fbc8f1c20fd24898fac094f87c5a3c54a06136",
          "message": "refactor: split cnum.jl and simplify coefficient construction and arithmetic (#323)\n\n* refactor: split cnum.jl and simplify coefficient construction and arithmetic\n\n* refactor: one builder and sign rule for phases, shared Fourier map and trig relations\n\n* fix: real and imag split phases with an amplitude; one radical reader\n\n* refactor: shared factor loop for lowering, one fold for exponential and rational forms\n\n* refactor: radicals module, canonical monomial, Base operators on Coeff, compound atoms\n\n* chore: drop changelog entries from refactor\n\n* fix: restore concrete inv methods on GaussianRational for JET\n\n* fix: narrow rewrite_complex_slots to RawExpression for JET",
